1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:02,350
(Leonard:)Just not against their will.

2
00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:10,090
(Leonard:)You really think you should be
eating that cake?

3
00:00:10,090 --> 00:00:11,060
(Sheldon:)Why?

4
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,360
(Leonard:)If you're gonna be

5
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:14,060
(Leonard:)a trophy husband
for a rich wife,

6
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:16,600
(Leonard:)you might want
to watch your waistline.

7
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:17,800
(Raj:)He's right.

8
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:20,800
(Raj:)A minute on the lips,
a lifetime on the hips.

9
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:22,670
(Howard:)Yeah, ha-ha.

10
00:00:22,670 --> 00:00:26,240
(Howard:)First of all, I'm not threatened
by my fiancée's success.

11
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:27,340
(Howard:)I'm proud of her.

12
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:29,010
(Howard:)And secondly,
I have my own career.

13
00:00:29,010 --> 00:00:33,150
(Leonard:)Until you have kids.

14
00:00:33,150 --> 00:00:34,950
(Sheldon:)Good news, Raj.

15
00:00:34,950 --> 00:00:36,850
(Sheldon:)I got the blood work
back from the lab.

16
00:00:36,850 --> 00:00:39,490
(Sheldon:)You're okay to stay for a while.

17
00:00:39,490 --> 00:00:41,060
(Raj:)When did you take my blood?

18
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:43,290
(Sheldon:)Not important.

19
00:00:43,290 --> 00:00:46,130
(Sheldon:)Your sugar was a little high.

20
00:00:46,130 --> 00:00:48,700
(Sheldon:)I'd follow up
with your regular physician.

21
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:50,460
(Sheldon:)In the meantime, I have some
paperwork here

22
00:00:50,470 --> 00:00:51,700
(Sheldon:)for you to go over.

23
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:52,730
(Raj:)What the hell is this?

24
00:00:52,730 --> 00:00:54,500
(Sheldon:)Boilerplate stuff.

25
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:57,770
(Sheldon:)A modified roommate agreement
for a temporary house guest.

26
00:00:57,770 --> 00:01:01,540
(Sheldon:)And a living will and durable
power of attorney.

